# Optional. Leave empty when the frontend and the API share one origin
# (Vite proxy in dev, reverse proxy in production).
# Set it only when the API lives on a different origin, e.g. https://api.example.com
# (no trailing slash). The API must then list this site in CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS.
# This is the URL of our own FastAPI backend, never the upstream CMIIT URL:
# VITE_ variables are public in the browser bundle.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=